# 📎 샘플 코드 스니펫(요지)

**SPSC 링버퍼(헤드/테일 패딩)**

```cpp
struct alignas(64) Index { std::atomic<uint32_t> v{0}; char pad[64-4]; };
template<size_t N> struct Spsc {
  static_assert((N & (N-1))==0, "pow2");
  Index head, tail;
  KeyEvent buf[N];
  bool push(const KeyEvent& e){
    auto h = head.v.load(std::memory_order_relaxed);
    auto t = tail.v.load(std::memory_order_acquire);
    if (((h+1)&(N-1)) == (t&(N-1))) return false; // full
    buf[h&(N-1)] = e;
    head.v.store((h+1)&(N-1), std::memory_order_release);
    return true;
  }
  bool pop(KeyEvent& out){
    auto t = tail.v.load(std::memory_order_relaxed);
    auto h = head.v.load(std::memory_order_acquire);
    if (t==h) return false; // empty
    out = buf[t&(N-1)];
    tail.v.store((t+1)&(N-1), std::memory_order_release);
    return true;
  }
};
```

**오디오 콜백 내 소비**

```cpp
void audioTick(int64_t T_audio_ms){
  KeyEvent e;
  while (inputQ.pop(e)){
    // lookahead 허용
    if (e.t_dev_ms <= T_audio_ms + 4) consumeInput(e);
    else { stash.push(e); break; } // 미래 이벤트는 다음 콜백으로
  }
  processJudgement(T_audio_ms);  // Δ 계산, 게이지, SFX
}
```

